[38;5;252m[1m## Behavior preserved rather than fixed[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mDISPATCH_REP[0m's [38;5;10mswitch[0m only has cases 0–6 even though [38;5;10mREP7[0m exists, so [38;5;10muse_generated(7)[0m returns just the seed. With [38;5;10mREPEAT=7[0m the C output shows [38;5;10macc=5040[0m but [38;5;10mgen.acc=1[0m for mul; the Rust does the same.[0m[0m
